WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:03.660
My passionate idol activities,

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:07.310
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:14.200
I'm Hoshimiya Ichigo, a middle school third-year at the idol school Starlight Academy.

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:19.220
There's a new idol school called Dream Academy, or DreAca for short.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:26.790
Otoshiro Seira-chan and her producer Saegusa Kii-chan, who recently debuted as an idol, are both amazing!

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:30.040
My Aikatsu is getting even more passionate!

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.170
She's just so cute!

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:34.680
Who, who?

00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:38.230
An idol from Dream Academy, Kazesawa Sora-chan.

00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:40.830
Kazesawa Sora-chan!

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:43.690
She's the one we saw when we snuck into DreAca, right?

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:44.640
Correct.

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:51.870
Sora-chan is a popular idol enrolled in both DreAca's idol and designer courses.

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:58.660
You mean she's also studying how to create Aikatsu cards?

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:03.410
Yeah. There's even a rumor saying that she might start her own brand.

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:07.110
It's amazing how she's both cute <i>and</i> talented.

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:09.730
She's something special!

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:14.140
Kazesawa Sora-chan, huh.

00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:16.800
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:18.430
I wonder what kind of idol she is.

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:21.930
Sparkle splash shining!

00:01:22.370 --> 00:01:23.430
Sparkle splash!

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:27.640
Spin, spin.

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:29.090
Cutie cute. {I thought long and hard about this one... and nothing}{it's good though}

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:15.060
I've decided who the idol to follow Otoshiro Seira and Saegusa Kii-chan in taking the next step will be. {goddamnit sentence}

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:18.760
Kazesawa Sora.

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:27.720
Spin spin, cutie cute.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:31.600
Squish squish, cutie cute.

00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:39.610
Let's, let's, go, go! Oh, oh, oh!

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:42.610
Kii, you've been really hyped up all day.

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:46.680
Today's DreAca's designer course's semesterly exhibition.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:50.430
We get to check up on all the clothes and stuff they made!

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:52.190
I guess that's true.

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:53.480
Ah, here she is!

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:58.380
She's Kazesawa Sora-chan. I've got my eye on her.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:02.800
Sora-chan, I have a photo shoot in this uniform coming up.

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:04.890
How can I look cuter in it?

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:15.880
Spin spin, cutie cute.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:18.460
Swish, swish, cutie cute.{not the same. alt: silky, silky}

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:20.900
Sparkle, splash, cutie cute.

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:24.720
And now...

00:04:27.670 --> 00:04:29.640
Tilt your neck a bit.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:33.330
Good. And now open your lips a little.

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:37.540
You're tremendously cute!

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:40.840
She really did turn cuter.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:42.050
Cute!

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:44.280
It's like you cast magic on me!

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:45.400
Thanks!

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:50.180
Kazesawa Sora.

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:54.980
I can't believe how good she is at bringing out an idol's appeal.

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:59.560
Yeah. Maybe it's because she's both an idol and a designer.

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:04.070
The clothes Sora-chan made are going to be on display today, too.

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:15.660
She made something this awesome all by herself.

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:17.330
Thank you for coming to see them.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:21.390
Right, I'm Otoshiro Seira.

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:24.430
And I'm her producer, Saegusa Kii!

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:25.840
She's also an idol.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.150
I know.

00:05:27.150 --> 00:05:28.770
I'm Kazesawa Sora.

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:29.890
Nice to meet you.

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:31.210
Same here.

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:36.850
So Sora-chan makes clothes that are ethnic, western...

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:38.410
Bohemian.

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:42.810
A lot of my designs are arrangements of their traditional garb in mature ways.

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:47.110
So the concept was "ethnic coord", right?

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:49.120
Yes, something like that.

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:50.370
Like that?

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.830
The teachers say that's what it is,

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:56.620
but I don't think about concepts at all.

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.130
I just make what comes to mind.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:00.920
How free-spirited.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.130
Ah, Seira and Kii-chan.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:07.010
You've got good sense, coming straight to Sora's exhibit.

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:08.550
Headmistress Tiara.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:11.170
I have something to talk to you about.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:11.970
Yes?

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:13.460
Sora,

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:16.850
as a designer, go ahead and start your own brand.

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:19.810
What a development!

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:20.860
A brand?!

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:24.860
Everyone in the designer course studies the creation of clothes.

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:29.340
However, there has yet to be a single student to start her own brand. {come to think of it, can males be in the designer course? there are male designers...}

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:32.370
You could be the first.

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:36.620
Me? Start my own brand?

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:42.670
Yes, a new brand to compete with
Angely Sugar, Swing Rock, and the like! {or as good as, famous, etc}

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:44.650
I know you can do it, Sora.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:48.060
Wow, Sora-chan!

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:49.510
Go for it!

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:56.710
Yes, Headmistress.

00:06:56.710 --> 00:06:57.890
Leave it to me.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:59.900
I knew you'd be up for it!

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:02.310
I'll be there if you need me.

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:07.230
Sora-chan's making history! Ok-ok-okay!

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:08.150
Yeah.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:14.910
Starting your own brand is a pretty big deal. {didn't they just meet? why are they friends already?}{literally forced friendship}

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:19.410
There aren't any designers with brands that are also idols.

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:27.340
You really don't get nervous, do you?

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:30.950
Creating your own brand is no walk in the park.

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:33.330
I'm nervous right now.

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.680
It doesn't show at all, though.

00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:37.680
Maybe.

00:07:38.110 --> 00:07:42.190
I'm actually conflicted about how I should proceed.

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:48.440
You see, I've always made clothes how and when I've wanted to.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:50.460
A lot like a hobby. {holy shit this is a time when shumi can actually be translated as hobby}

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:55.450
But if I started my own brand, I wouldn't be able to do that.

00:07:55.930 --> 00:07:59.950
I'd have to keep announcing new clothes periodically.

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:04.400
Even if I had no inspiration, I'd still have to make something.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:05.690
Because it'd be my job.

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:10.060
It's like how idols have to take the stage even if they have a cold.

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:15.750
So I was thinking about whether I could do it...

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:20.850
Also, I saw your performances before.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:27.860
Seira rocked the Swing Rock 
premium dress spectacularly.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:33.620
And Kii-chan, you wore Magical Toy's Variety Tile coord, right?

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:36.910
It really brought out your cuteness.

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:38.360
Thank you.

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:46.380
Designers have the responsibility to draw out an idol's appeal with their outfits.

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:50.010
I wasn't sure if I could do that either.

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:53.380
I should go now.

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:54.900
Here.

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:56.640
A reward for listening to my ramblings.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:59.040
Did you just make these?

00:08:59.040 --> 00:08:59.640
Yes.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:06.020
Looks good.

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:09.570
Sora, thanks.

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:10.520
Thanks!

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:19.070
It's rare for you to be lost in thought.

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:26.710
I think Sora-chan could be a really good designer!

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:30.810
So if she's worried about things, I want to help her out.

00:09:30.810 --> 00:09:31.840
Back there...

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:37.090
When she saw us wearing these, she looked really happy.

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:42.770
Like she was happy that what she made looked good on us.

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:48.100
Maybe you're right.

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:52.830
I want her to have fun making clothes for her brand too!

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:53.550
Yeah.

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:56.240
But what should I do?

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:58.740
Compy, help me out!

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:01.030
Why don't you go talk to Sora?

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:06.060
I'm sure your producer powers will be able to help her out.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:22.010
Sora.

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:24.060
It's Seira and Kii.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:25.640
Come on in.

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:28.530
Coming right in!

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:32.020
I-Is there someone else here?

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:35.830
Come on, Palm. {.................}{you accidentally an Engrish}

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:36.970
Greet them.

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:39.570
Bohenichiwa!

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:41.530
A parrot?

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:44.030
Yeah, he's Palm-chan the parrot.

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:45.880
He's cute.

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:48.050
I started keeping him when I was abroad.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:52.280
Wow. Sora-chan, you went abroad?

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:53.540
When I was a kid.

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:58.990
That was when I met the person who inspired me to be a designer.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:06.930
When I was five, I met Mimi-san the Bohemian in Marrakesh, Morocco.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:08.630
Bohemian?

00:11:08.630 --> 00:11:13.050
Bohemians are people that live very free and roaming lifestyles.

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.100
Sora, wait right here.

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:19.030
Okay.

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:46.470
Please look all you'd like! {I would normally think she means dancing, but she goes over to her accessories, so...}

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:07.350
Interested?

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:09.510
Yeah, you're really good!

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:11.750
I've done this for a long time.

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:14.130
Long time? Here?

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:16.240
Well, now I'm here.

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:17.750
Now?

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:24.870
Yes. I used to travel the world, 
opening up shop wherever I went.

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:28.260
But now I live in that building over there.

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:32.730
Squeeze, puff.

00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:34.770
Pat pat.

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:37.730
Squeeze, puff.

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:40.330
Pat pat.

00:12:42.050 --> 00:12:43.030
All done.

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:45.510
Cool!

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:46.780
You want it?

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:49.790
No, I want to try making one!

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:57.070
What's that you've got there?

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:58.040
I got it.

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:00.970
From this lady called Mimi-san.

00:13:00.970 --> 00:13:02.070
Flop.

00:13:02.070 --> 00:13:03.680
Squish, squish.

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:05.260
Puff, puff.

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:08.290
Sora, get to sleep.

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:10.260
Just a little longer. {Mom gives no fucks}

00:13:12.050 --> 00:13:12.930
Flop.

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:14.310
Squish, squish.

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:16.420
Puff, puff.

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:21.270
Ever since that day, I've loved making things.

00:13:21.270 --> 00:13:22.690
Puff, puff...

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:35.330
Whenever I made something, I'd go to Mimi-san's shop.

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.290
Spin, spin.

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:52.560
Puff, puff.

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:58.350
Hey Mimi-san, you traveled the world making these things, right?

00:13:58.350 --> 00:13:59.810
Yeah, that's right.

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:02.360
Why are you here right now?

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:06.880
I got a little scared.

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:09.620
Scared to open new doors.

00:14:16.810 --> 00:14:19.220
You've gotten a lot better, Sora.

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:20.420
You think so?

00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:23.920
It's really amazing how hard you keep working at it.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.390
You're the amazing one, Mimi-san.

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:32.930
The reason I'm making these is because I loved watching you work so hard.

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:35.180
Squish, puff.

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:39.650
Watching you make these cast a magic spell on me.

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:43.900
Here.

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:47.190
Puff!

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:53.830
It's really pretty. Thanks.

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:58.580
Magic, huh.

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:03.590
Accessories and clothing—that is, fashion, might be a kind of magic.

00:15:04.580 --> 00:15:09.340
Magic that gives you energy when you want to create a new self.

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:13.950
I want to make these when I grow up.

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:16.350
Can I become who I want to be? {I want to keep "will I", but length and ugh}

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:19.480
As long as you keep doing what you're doing, I'm sure you can.

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:21.560
How can you tell?

00:15:22.070 --> 00:15:24.980
Because I'm getting energy from you right now.

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:31.900
So Mimi-san was the person who inspired you to be a designer.

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:36.390
But one day, Mimi-san disappeared.

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:48.890
Hey Mimi-san, look! I made a new one!

00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:13.530
<i>Thank you. Because of you, I've recovered the drive to try doing more things.</i>

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:18.560
<i>I'm going to travel the world and find something else I want to make. {ital'd for now, I think it's appropriate}</i>

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:29.340
Mimi-san must have gone back to her free-roaming, world-traveling Bohemian lifestyle.

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:31.120
They must have been really pretty.

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:34.970
The accessories you gave Mimi-san.

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:39.470
Those accessories cast the magic of fashion on Mimi-san

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:43.400
and inspired her to reimagine herself.

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:46.730
That's why she left to travel the world.

00:16:47.890 --> 00:16:50.790
I had been wondering why she suddenly left like that.

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:55.600
That never crossed my mind. {or The thought}

00:16:56.650 --> 00:17:02.000
I'm sure your brand will do well if you stay as free-spirited as you are now.

00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:06.070
There are lots of people out there who'd be inspired by your designs.

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:07.580
Just like Mimi-san!

00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:19.620
I always thought that if I ever started a brand, I'd call it "Bohemian".

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:20.890
Really?

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:27.490
It was Mimi-san the Bohemian who inspired me to become a designer in the first place, after all.

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:34.250
But since it's important for me to continue being myself,

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:39.800
I'll add a sky that I can fly freely in—a me-colored sky,

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:42.050
and create a me-colored brand!

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:49.480
Bohemian Sky.

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:56.220
The day has finally arrived!

00:17:56.220 --> 00:18:03.470
Today, Kazesawa Sora, the Dream Academy idol, will unveil her new brand!

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:07.600
The long-awaited ethnic brand!

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:10.110
The brand name is...

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:12.160
<i>Bohemian Sky.</i>

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:14.690
<i>My brand.</i>

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:17.950
<i>I'll cast my magic upon the stage!</i>

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:35.890
Sora-chan's really something special!

00:21:35.890 --> 00:21:38.290
Both her outfit and her singing were really cool.

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:38.900
Yeah.

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:41.780
Aikatsu's getting more passionate!

00:21:42.270 --> 00:21:47.180
Awesome! Kazesawa Sora-chan even pulled off a Constellation Appeal! {caps}

00:21:47.180 --> 00:21:50.050
Gotta write a special edition of Aikatsu News!

00:21:50.050 --> 00:21:51.330
Do your best.

00:21:52.690 --> 00:21:54.590
Great success, Sora!

00:21:54.590 --> 00:21:55.410
Huh?

00:22:13.270 --> 00:22:15.500
<i>I wonder if you delivered energy to them,{why not consistent? also, this snow reminded me that it really is still following our calendar}</i>

00:22:18.510 --> 00:22:21.040
<i>my Bohemian Sky.</i>

00:23:55.680 --> 00:23:57.700
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism.

00:23:58.890 --> 00:24:01.560
Your Bohemian Sky dress was beautiful.

00:24:01.560 --> 00:24:02.570
Thanks.

00:24:02.570 --> 00:24:04.990
I think I really got a me-colored dress.

00:24:04.990 --> 00:24:06.730
I'd like to try it on.

00:24:07.890 --> 00:24:09.840
Fashion is magic.

00:24:10.830 --> 00:24:12.810
Next week, it'll almost be here...

00:24:12.810 --> 00:24:14.300
Merry Christmas!

00:24:14.610 --> 00:24:16.180
A gigantic cake!

00:24:16.180 --> 00:24:17.930
And planning a special party!

00:24:18.250 --> 00:24:19.810
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.810 --> 00:24:21.600
Idols are Santa Claus. {I'll leave it to your discretion to choose either yours or mine. it's not like we can predict the future. Also, it's Flash!}

00:24:21.600 --> 00:24:24.110
Always passionate, idol activities!
